{"id":"96lyachszk","type":"book","title":"新鐫全部繡像紅樓夢","edition":"倉石本","work_id":"d59df01avcw0","authors":[{"name":"曹霑","role":"撰","dynasty":"清","entity_id":"hixhd2h9bhbk"},{"name":"高鶚","role":"續補","dynasty":"清"},{"name":"程偉元","role":"編刻","dynasty":"清"},{"name":"倉石武四郎","role":"舊藏","dynasty":"近代"}],"publication_info":{"year":"1792","details":"清乾隆五十七年壬子萃文書屋木活字本"},"dating":{"era":"清","year":1792,"certainty":"attested","source":"catalog","basis":"出版著錄「1792」"},"current_location":{"name":"日本東京大學東洋文化研究所（倉石武四郎舊藏）"},"description":{"text":"程乙本《紅樓夢》之倉石本。日本漢學家倉石武四郎（1897-1975）舊藏，今藏東京大學東洋文化研究所。2014 年日本汲古書院影印發行。\n\n**版本注意**：學界經太田辰夫、伊藤漱平先後對校，確認本本實為**程甲、程乙各 60 回的混裝本**，並非純正程乙本。出版說明云「甲本六十回、乙本六十回」即是此意；其中認定為程甲（乙）的某回中，間或夾雜程乙（甲）頁，甚至有抄補現象。雖屬混裝，但因含程乙本版本信息，學界仍納入程乙本研究視野。","sources":[]},"juan_count":{"number":120},"measures":[{"unit":"回","number":120}],"measure_info":"一百二十回","lineage":{"year":1792,"category":"活字本","status":"extant","derived_from":[{"ref":"96kzkmzcow","ref_type":"book","relation":"混裝本","confidence":"consensus","evidence":"2014 汲古書院出版說明云「乙本六十回」，實際混裝有程甲頁"}]},"revision":"1.0.14","revised_at":"2026-05-17","resource_groups":{"chengyi-cangshi":{"label":"程乙本（倉石本）","description":""}},"resources":[{"id":"ia-hongloumeng-chengyi-cangshi","name":"Internet Archive","url":"https://archive.org/details/hongloumeng-chengyi-cangshi","types":["image"],"group":"chengyi-cangshi","group_role":"mirror"},{"id":"baidu-chengyi-cangshi","name":"百度网盘","url":"https://pan.baidu.com/s/1BY4Rmk2BUdb5ePBkeQYzkA?pwd=0000#list/path=%2Fbook-index%2F96lyachszk%2Fchengyi-cangshi","types":["image"],"group":"chengyi-cangshi","group_role":"mirror","metadata":{"access_code":"0000"}}],"has_image":true,"_path":"Book/s/z/k/96lyachszk-新鐫全部繡像紅樓夢倉石本.json","_isDraft":false}